{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t國際高等教育研究機構QS公布最新亞洲大學排名，香港共有五間大學躋身十強。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n署理行政長官陳國基形容最新排名是政府持續投入資源、政策導向清晰，以及各大學努力的成果。他表示，香港不會停下腳步，會擁抱多元文化與前沿思維，致力培育具全球視野的創新人才。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：梁家奇\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T11:05:28.557986+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T10:49:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T15:19:42.274537+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T10:58:41.406684+00:00","content_hash":"3262e9b599cac407988a28a967673fba39c489df1a074de0ab0a2a83faed3f27","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}